<QFT version="4" name="Unstable plant, Tharewal 3.6" description="Example 3.6 of Tharewal 2005: k(s+a)/(s(s-2.5)), an integrator and an unstable pole, with a stability margin of 2.1 as its only specification and a static gain as the controller, as the paper poses it. At the five design frequencies only: between them, at 2.14 rad/s, the design exceeds the margin by 0.05 dB; unstable-extended asks it at every frequency.">
